     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">Hey guys:</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">I trust you are doing great! Thanks for the awesome package you created.</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">I&#39;m testing metacodeR through the example of &#39;voting geography&#39; (<a href=\"https://grunwaldlab.github.io/metacoder_documentation/publication--08--voting.html\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(3,102,214)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://grunwaldlab.github.io/metacoder_documentation/publication--08--voting.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792498881371000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2TDIHe1pbDhoZaFVGGGE4T\">https://grunwaldlab.github.io/metacoder_documentation/publication--08--voting.html</a>), and am getting errors when running the function parse_taxonomy_table.</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">Everything before the below command line was being fine.</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">Then, I got an error here:</p><h2 style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:24px;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:1.5em;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25;padding-bottom:0.3em;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(234,236,239);color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;\"></h2><blockquote style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px 0px 16px;padding:0px 1em;color:rgb(106,115,125);border-left-width:0.25em;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(223,226,229);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">voting_data &lt;- parse_taxonomy_table(input = data, taxon_col = c(&quot;class&quot; = -1), other_col_type = &quot;obs_info&quot;, class_sep = &quot;\\|&quot;)</p></blockquote><h2 style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:24px;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:1.5em;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25;padding-bottom:0.3em;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(234,236,239);color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;\"></h2><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">Error:</p><h2 style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:24px;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:1.5em;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25;padding-bottom:0.3em;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(234,236,239);color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;\"></h2><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">Error in parse_taxonomy_table(input = data, taxon_col = c(class = -1), :<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">argument &quot;file_path&quot; is missing, with no default</p><blockquote style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px 0px 16px;padding:0px 1em;color:rgb(106,115,125);border-left-width:0.25em;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(223,226,229);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">sessionInfo()<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">R version 3.3.2 (2016-10-31)<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Platform: x86_64-apple-darwin13.4.0 (64-bit)<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Running under: OS X El Capitan 10.11.6</p></blockquote><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">locale:<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">[1] en_CA.UTF-8/en_CA.UTF-8/en_CA.UTF-8/C/en_CA.UTF-8/en_CA.UTF-8</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">attached base packages:<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">[1] stats graphics grDevices utils datasets methods base</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">other attached packages:<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">[1] metacoder_0.1.2</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">loaded via a namespace (and not attached):<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">[1] magrittr_1.5 R6_2.2.0 assertthat_0.1 DBI_0.5-1 tools_3.3.2 dplyr_0.5.0<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">[7] tibble_1.2 Rcpp_0.12.9</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">Can you please help me to find why this is happening?</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">Thank you,</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\">Andre</p></div>"
